cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "PartialCorrelationSpikeSlab.jl"
abstract: >-
  Julia implementation of the partial correlation spike-and-slab (PCSS)
  estimator of a sparse Gaussian graphical model. The estimator places a
  spike-and-slab prior with a uniform slab on the partial correlations, and
  computes a maximum a posteriori estimate by an ECM algorithm along a
  continuation path in its single hyperparameter, which can be set to a
  calibrated value that depends only on the sample size and the number of
  variables.
authors:
